{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0202_story_004yuk02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_004yuk02_title", "source_sha256": "dc35349ee2bcaf3854b7c0f8abd01d74363167f7c35e7fed7def35437631790b", "ja": "雪歩とおでかけ2", "zh": "与雪步出门2", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0202_story_004yuk02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_004yuk02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "c651478379a8228a6d93825e11f6d494d2f8e434c69d419572de6086ee1a8c21", "ja": "雪歩とおでかけした一幕です。", "zh": "这是和雪步一起外出时的一幕。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0202_story_004yuk02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_004yuk02_1000_004yuk", "source_sha256": "5ef36d83d9007f7ee3529dd95c0ce55746eb4c5e840aa6b618e1d365846f2fd5", "ja": "あの、{$P$}。今日は\n付き合ってくれて、ありがとうございました。", "zh": "那个，{$P$}。今天\n谢谢您能陪我出来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0202_story_004yuk02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_004yuk02_1001_004yuk", "source_sha256": "aba88a68bb94d0f8db804c53b239c7725b52b0e92bdf3585a7ad0711402bf1d3", "ja": "鹿児島には茶畑があるって聞いて、気になってたので\n……連れていってもらえて、うれしかったです。", "zh": "听说鹿儿岛有茶田，我一直很在意……能带我去那里，我真的很开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0202_story_004yuk02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_004yuk02_1002_p", "source_sha256": "61132018f4b5353be9e70cc1bab6c31712f6a18ee24bfbf8b75b6977587eb0d9", "ja": "どういたしまして。\n雪歩が楽しめたみたいで良かったよ。", "zh": "不客气。雪步好像玩得很开心，我也就放心了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0202_story_004yuk02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_004yuk02_1003_p", "source_sha256": "9cc8b1ee42b56be77732fd176330c3e1b2e27791674ae747db0b50d7d53e3b3d", "ja": "俺も雪歩に色々教えてもらって、\nなんだかお茶に詳しくなった気がするな。", "zh": "我也从雪步那里学到了不少东西，感觉自己好像也变得懂茶了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0202_story_004yuk02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_004yuk02_1004_004yuk", "source_sha256": "4c0b3e77c4456afbc5eafc653231f7589b3296e41fcb00f9e2cad8789ee04bd3", "ja": "えへへ、本当ですか？　私、もしかして\nしゃべり過ぎたかもって思ってたんですけど……。", "zh": "嘿嘿，真的吗？我还在想，我是不是一不小心说得太多了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0202_story_004yuk02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_004yuk02_1005_004yuk", "source_sha256": "6121baed1a501bf24438f3b660b1196ef44c159c0aa257fc4a4db31af13e612d", "ja": "でも、お土産にお茶っ葉も買えたし、\n本当に素敵な一日でした……♪", "zh": "不过，我还买到了茶叶当伴手礼，今天真的是美好的一天……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0202_story_004yuk02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_004yuk02_1006_004yuk", "source_sha256": "13c9f4f615d7eff6ef73f76395d230ab81918f046e1abfa940ac6d01393a10b2", "ja": "あの、{$P$}。劇場に帰ったら、\nお土産のお茶を淹れますから、飲んでくださいね。", "zh": "那个，{$P$}。回剧场后，我会泡上作为伴手礼的茶，请您喝哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0202_story_004yuk02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_004yuk02_1007_p", "source_sha256": "fd5350c1094ca365577636b1a8bbd3d8aa08d1ea7f6d9f0730d57c0387ae0608", "ja": "ああ。でも、お土産なんだろ？\n俺はみんなの後でいいよ。", "zh": "啊。不过，这是特产吧？\n我最后喝就好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0202_story_004yuk02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_004yuk02_1008_004yuk", "source_sha256": "bc6de75c1161f8a0ddea2a18f9041163ed59123f2fa168d6465d46dad8edaa6e", "ja": "いえっ、これはお礼なので……最初の一杯は、\n{$P$}に飲んでほしいです。ふふっ♪", "zh": "不，这是谢礼……第一杯，想请{$P$}先生喝。呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
